{"id": "59579", "title": "天娇乱情", "author": "杏花红", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 16, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/59/59579.htm", "intro": "人死後，不是有牛头马脸来勾魂的吗？ \r\n人死後，不是要不上天堂，要不下地府吗？ \r\n怎麽我死後变成牛头马脸不来勾，天堂地府都不要的孤魂野鬼了？ \r\n\r\n神圣无双的他说：“你我永远是一体” \r\n温润如玉的他说：“我只想永远待在你身边” \r\n邪肆冷绝的他说：“你以为你甩得了我吗？” \r\n霸气狂情的他说：“我只要你一个！” \r\n妖孽惑人的她说：“你在哪，我去哪。” \r\n\r\n她？喂！人家不是蕾丝边，不要行不行？ \r\n\r\n（肉味十足，亲们慎入）", "base": "files/article/html/59/59579", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "8685190.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "8685192.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "8685193.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "8685198.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "8685200.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "8685202.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "8685205.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-39", "file": "8685206.html", "available": false}, {"title": "40-48", "file": "8685207.html", "available": false}, {"title": "49-57", "file": "8685210.html", "available": false}, {"title": "58-63", "file": "8685213.html", "available": false}, {"title": "64-65", "file": "8685214.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-72", "file": "8685215.html", "available": false}, {"title": "73-78", "file": "8685216.html", "available": false}, {"title": "79-85", "file": "8685218.html", "available": false}, {"title": "86-93", "file": "8685219.html", "available": false}]}